			"title": "[Feat] Destroyable crate",
			"description": "A destroyable crate that can be jumped on to bounce, destroyed with attack, or destroyed with jumping under it with player's head.\n\nRemember: A crate can later on be full of pickuppables and has to be hit multiple times.",
			"category": "26929272-0dbe-4941-9cf2-829cf0257dce",
			"steps": [
