		{
			"uuid": "021a9fd2-46d0-4f08-bc77-a558c6c82145",
			"title": "[Feat] Moving obstacle",
			"description": "The level should have a \"sweeping obstacle\".\n\nA sweeping obstacle is a dangerous object moving from left to right and vice versa, player has to time moving forward to move along.\n\nIdea: Mom sweeping a mop aka cleaning, door opening and closing.",
